          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Ngamp’rymei Pu, gaeklou ngammei,",
            "Duiluat guay ta khaam ngammei pu,",
            "Daihmei duipuisyng ’thukmei ta,",
            "Kanganv, kathukh riatloumei pu,",
            "Duipui khou ’gyn bammei nunc ta,",
            "Siimei guay khou $%6 gaeklou o.",
            "",
            "2 He chyng ’zaengc guay Kaipou Ravguangc,",
            "’Niw ’gyn phaylaanna tat pwkhou,",
            "Chyng, ’zaengc khow ’tauh ram kathuic khou,",
            "Nang nac nunc tatpui bamv ’thuic khou,",
            "Nang baancpwam $%6 gaeklou na ro,",
            "Kabiu nuhmei kathuic khou $%6.",
            "3 He Pu $%6 thoucloumei Bumaengc,",
            "Tingpuk laamv ’tyng khang keymei pu,",
            "He tingkauh pwan Nang nac nunc $%6",
            "Samcna tat pwkhou gaeklou o;",
            "Tingpuk laan khou kabiu nuhmei,",
            "Kaguay khou $%6 gaek duaklou o.",
            "",
            "4 He Gaanv Thumh khat swmei Ravguangc,",
            "Nang nac nunc tatpui bamv ’thuic khou",
            "Thing-’tauh, dui-mai lev howmumei",
            "Kaguay khou $%6 gaekduaklou o;",
            "Nang ta thuanhmei khwan kauc thau diu,",
            "Tingpuk, kandih, duipui khou $%6."
          ]
        }
      },
